// caustic-image/formats/vp8.cst
// VP8 (WebP lossy) intra-frame decoder — RFC 6386 keyframe path: boolean
// arithmetic decoder, frame/segment/filter/quant headers, coefficient
// probability updates, per-MB intra modes + DCT token residuals, WHT/IDCT
